{"id":30256,"artist":"Depeche Mode","title":"Halo","lyrics_plain":"You are my reason to live\nAll I own I would give\nJust to have you adore me\nTill the moon deserts the sky\nTill all the seas run dry\nTill then I'll worship you\nTill the tropic sun turns cold\nTill this young world grows old\nMy darling, I'll adore you\nYou are my reason to live\nAll I own I would give\nJust to have you adore me\nTill the rivers flow upstream\nTill lovers cease to dream\nTill then I'm yours, be mine .","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] 作词 : Martin Gore\n[00:01.00] 作曲 : Martin Gore\n[00:25.29]You wear guilt\n[00:27.71]Like shackles on your feet\n[00:31.95]Like a halo in reverse\n[00:42.29]I can feel\n[00:44.76]The discomfort in your seat\n[00:49.21]And in your head it's worse\n[01:16.50]There's a pain\n[01:19.08]A famine in your heart\n[01:23.26]An aching to be free\n[01:33.23]Can't you see\n[01:36.44]All love's luxuries\n[01:40.63]Are here for you and me\n[01:53.55]And when our worlds they fall apart\n[01:57.57]When the walls come tumbling in\n[02:02.35]Though we may deserve it\n[02:06.42]It will be worth it\n[02:16.44]Bring your chains\n[02:19.05]Your lips of tragedy\n[02:23.22]And fall into my arms\n[02:36.24]And when our worlds they fall apart\n[02:40.02]When the walls come tumbling in\n[02:44.92]Though we may deserve it\n[02:48.86]It will be worth it\n[03:01.99]And when our worlds they fall apart\n[03:05.98]When the walls come tumbling in\n[03:10.77]Though we may deserve it\n[03:14.90]It will be worth it\n[03:19.83]And when our worlds they fall apart\n[03:23.24]When the walls come tumbling in\n[03:27.81]Though we may deserve it\n[03:31.96]It will be worth it\n[03:36.30]And when our worlds they fall apart\n[03:40.13]When the walls come tumbling in\n[03:44.85]Though we may deserve it\n[03:48.87]It will be worth it\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:00.00] <00:00.00>作词 <00:00.25>: <00:00.50>Martin <00:00.75>Gore\n[00:01.00] <00:01.00>作曲 <00:02.50>: <00:04.00>Martin <00:05.50>Gore\n[00:25